cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use lupa, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "lupa: Data Profiling and Quality Measurement"
abstract: >-
  Profiles tabular data and measures its quality. Discovers structural
  patterns, implicit types, mixed date formats and reusable findings about
  potential data issues; defines quality frameworks with user-declared
  dimensions, reusable metrics with explicit granularity and typed
  aggregation; keeps versioned histories and detects structural drift; writes
  self-contained HTML reports; and produces editable cleaning plans that apply
  only the actions the user selects, with an audit log. It profiles data
  frames in memory and tables inside a database through DBI.
authors:
  - family-names: Lucas
    given-names: Sebastián
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-9068-0276"
